Copyright 2026 Hailey Collet

This package is an original synthesis of hierarchical binary-question rubrics,
judge protocols, and deterministic score aggregation for creative writing and
related generation tasks (HBQ-RS 1.2.1).

Bibliographic entries in sources/bibliography.json and the discussion in
docs/RESEARCH_SYNTHESIS.md identify research that informed the design
(including BinEval, RubricBench, Autorubric, LitBench, LongJudgeBench,
WritingBench, and earlier craft-rubric literature). Those papers remain under
their own licenses and copyrights. This repository does not copy paper text
and does not relicense those works.

Technique-specific model-build modules (for example speculation/MTP
equivalence, pruning non-inferiority, or refusal-behavior checks) are optional
overlays. They are not required to judge prose, poetry, drama, or other
literary artifacts.
